		</a>
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kyledmanternach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
			<span class="sr-only">LinkedIn</span>
			<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" width="32" height="32">
				<path
					fill="currentColor"
					d="M4.98 3.5C4.98 4.88 3.88 6 2.5 6S0 4.88 0 3.5 1.12 1 2.5 1s2.48 1.12 2.48 2.5zM.5 8.5h4V24h-4V8.5zM8.5 8.5h3.8v2.1h.05c.53-1 1.84-2.1 3.79-2.1 4.05 0 4.8 2.67 4.8 6.14V24h-4v-7.7c0-1.84-.03-4.2-2.56-4.2-2.56 0-2.95 2-2.95 4.06V24h-4V8.5z"
				></path>
			</svg>
		</a>
	</div>
</footer>
<style>
	footer {
		padding: 2em 1em 4em 1em;
		background: transparent;
		color: #36454f;
		text-align: center;
	}
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) footer {
		color: #e6e4e3;
	}
	.social-links {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1em;
		margin-top: 1em;
	}
	.social-links a {
		text-decoration: none;
		color: #36454f;
	}
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) .social-links a {
		color: #e6e4e3;
	}
	.social-links a:hover {
		color: #111;
	}
</style>
